 ### [Parallel cache management with LRU](5268-parallel-cache-management-with-lru.md)
-A method by Sarton et al. [SCRL20] that generalizes page-table hierarchies for non-rendering purposes and processes cache misses on the GPU itself using CUDA shared memory to minimize memory transfers between CPU and GPU.
+A method by Sarton et al. [SCRL20] that generalizes page-table hierarchies for non-rendering purposes and processes cache misses on the GPU itself using CUDA shared memory to minimize memory transfers between CPU and GPU. It decouples cache residency management from the spatial subdivision, using a global usage buffer and an LRU buffer to keep frequently used bricks in the cache.
 
